# hand out. They match "ssh-" and long-base64 patterns but unlock nothing without
# the matching PRIVATE key (which lives in id_ed25519 / id_rsa — see
# ../../developer-cloud-tooling/). Contrast: no "BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY".

